.\n**Remaining uncertainty:** How severe C\u2019s communication problems are in practice and whether they lead to safety\u2011critical misunderstandings; also, the complete lack of teamwork/communication data for A, B, and D leaves their suitability in that domain unknown.\n**What would change my vote:** Concrete evidence that C\u2019s communication issues cause operational errors; or credible evidence that B or D demonstrate strong crew\u2011communication and cooperation that outweigh their interpersonal drawbacks; or evidence that A\u2019s technical strengths are paired with reliable, calm performance and effective crew interaction.\nMETADATA_JSON:\n{\"agent\": \"agent_3\", \"vote\": \"Candidate C\"}"}
